        "TileImage": "$($repository 4e3a4188-aa48-4bfd-8f03-4ae4b693ba69).Image",
        "Description": "Shiek Abdul Suleiman and Hector Delgado have been seen at the Miami races.  Our contractor suspects that they are trying to strike a deal to move cocaine into their territory. This offends our contractor, so much so he wants to let others know that this behavior will not be tolerated. Long story short, they&apos;re screwed.",
